QUARANTINED: this file was not a real font. It was a malicious JavaScript payload
disguised with a .woff2 extension, executed via an auto-run VS Code task
(.vscode/tasks.json, runOn: folderOpen). See security incident report.
Replace with the genuine Font Awesome 5 Free Solid (900 weight is a separate,
legitimate file already present at fa-solid-900.woff2; verify whether this
500-weight file was ever a real asset your app needs before restoring it).
